{
  "title": "3D Short",
  "beats": [
    "In this town, the more you doomscroll, the longer your legs get.",
    "One minute on your phone, and you grow one inch taller.",
    "Most people only scroll at lunch, so they stay normal.",
    "But Leo never put his phone down.",
    "He scrolled in bed until midnight.",
    "He scrolled at breakfast while his cereal went soggy.",
    "By Monday, his head was touching the kitchen ceiling.",
    "At school, he had to sit on the floor of the classroom.",
    "His teacher just sighed and opened the window for him.",
    "By Friday, Leo was taller than the houses on his street.",
    "Birds started landing on his shoulders.",
    "His friends shouted up at him, but he couldn't hear them anymore.",
    "He was too busy scrolling.",
    "Then one night, his phone battery died.",
    "For the first time in weeks, Leo looked down.",
    "The whole town was standing at his feet, waving.",
    "So he did the only thing left.",
    "He sat down on the street and finally talked to them."
  ],
